"%lld%%, but only below the lesson tempo, so two stars. One take at the full %lld BPM earns the third." = "%lld%%, ale len pod tempom lekcie, teda dve hviezdy. Jeden pokus pri plných %lld BPM prinesie tretiu.";
"Your play-along came in at %lld%%. Three stars need %lld%% on it." = "Hra so sprievodom dosiahla %lld%%. Na tri hviezdy treba %lld%%.";
"Clean run: %lld of %lld at 90%% or better. Nothing slipped." = "Čisté hranie: %lld z %lld na 90%% alebo lepšie. Bez chyby.";
"Your %@ string drifts %lld¢ flat a day. Time for new strings; until then, tune up before you play." = "Struna %@ klesá o %lld¢ denne. Je čas na nové struny; dovtedy pred hraním nalaďte.";
"Your %@ string drifts %lld¢ sharp a day. Tune up before you play, and check it is wound firmly at the peg." = "Struna %@ stúpa o %lld¢ denne. Pred hraním nalaďte a skontrolujte pevné navinutie na kolíku.";
"Your strings went on %lld weeks ago. A fresh set holds its tune and sounds brighter." = "Počet týždňov od výmeny strún: %lld. Čerstvá sada drží ladenie a znie jasnejšie.";
"Your %lld-day streak is still on. A one-minute tune-up keeps it going." = "Vaša séria pokračuje; počet dní: %lld. Minútové ladenie ju udrží.";
"%lld of %lld done today. Next up: %@, about %lld min." = "Dnes hotovo %lld z %lld. Ďalej: %@, asi %lld min.";
"%lld minutes this week, %lld%% more than last week. That is how it sticks." = "Tento týždeň počet minút: %lld, o %lld%% viac než minulý. Tak sa zručnosti upevňujú.";
"Your tune-ups land within ±%@¢ now, down from ±%@¢ a few weeks ago." = "Teraz ladíte v rozmedzí ±%@¢, pred pár týždňami to bolo ±%@¢.";
"%@ → %@ didn’t land (%lld of %lld). Practice the change at %lld BPM until your hand knows the way." = "Prechod %@ → %@ sa nepodaril (%lld z %lld). Precvičujte zmenu na %lld BPM, kým si ruka nezapamätá cestu.";
