"%@ → %@ was %lld ms late on beat %lld. Practice the change at %lld BPM until it lands." = "Prechod %@ → %@ sa oneskoril o %lld ms na dobe %lld. Precvičujte zmenu na %lld BPM, kým sa netrafíte.";
