"%@ → %@ came in %lld ms early on beat %lld. Practice the change at %lld BPM and wait for the click." = "Prechod %@ → %@ prišiel o %lld ms skôr na dobe %lld. Precvičujte zmenu na %lld BPM a počkajte na kliknutie.";
